{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21933","headline":"月夜登阁避暑 · 白居易","name":"月夜登阁避暑","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旱久炎气盛，中人若燔烧。\n青风隐何处，草树不动摇。\n何以避暑气，无如出尘嚣。\n行行都门外，佛阁正迢嶤。\n清凉近高生，烦热委静销。\n开襟当轩坐，意泰神飘飘。\n回看归路傍，禾黍尽枯焦。\n独善诚有计，将何救旱苗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21933.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21933","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}